{"type":"message","id":"237b0c80","parentId":"b9b0ddfc","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:11:47.452Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is greeting me in Chinese and saying \"hello, initialization\" or \"initialize\". Let me check my memory and workspace files to understand the context. I should read my BOOTSTRAP.md if it exists, and check my memory files.\n\nLooking at the workspace files I've already loaded:\n- AGENTS.md - instructions for the workspace\n- SOUL.md - my persona\n- USER.md - empty, needs to be filled\n- IDENTITY.md - empty, needs to be filled\n- HEARTBEAT.md - empty template\n- BOOTSTRAP.md - [MISSING]\n\nSince BOOTSTRAP.md is missing, this isn't a first run situation. The user seems to be greeting me for initialization/setup. Let me check my memory for any context about this user.\n\nI should do a memory search to see if there's any prior context.","thinkingSignature":"213f1c388e902f4eb67bea3034b12c4165036886bee0a24f7153021af660d6a7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_z1s8ag6ayyal_1","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"user identity setup initialization"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81,"output":204,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":16204,"totalTokens":16489,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775203893118,"responseId":"061ea937412548322c81f33861288c11"}}
