{"type":"message","id":"595699fe","parentId":"55d3e8b9","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:11:58.661Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No prior memory found. The user is greeting me for the first time in Chinese. Let me respond naturally in Chinese and help them set up / initialize. Since BOOTSTRAP.md is missing, I should just have a friendly first conversation and help them get started.\n\nI should introduce myself and help them set up their identity and preferences.","thinkingSignature":"8267a51627c5e45c4c927d63eac81bf3cdf2882ce9a0a61686d9b3cbf7c7d0c7"},{"type":"text","text":"你好！👋\n\n看起来这是我们第一次对话。让我先自我介绍一下——我是你的 AI 助手，运行在 OpenClaw 上。\n\n不过说实话，我现在对你还一无所知。我们来互相认识一下吧？\n\n**关于你：**\n- 你叫什么名字？\n- 怎么称呼你？\n- 你在哪个时区？\n\n**关于我：**\n你想给我起个名字吗？还是用默认的就行？\n\n有任何你想让我先了解或设置的事情吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":385,"output":163,"cacheRead":16146,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16694,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775203910827,"responseId":"061ea94922a18af80b31251c6be44d00"}}
