{"type":"message","id":"445c20fa","parentId":"80268132","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:16:21.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've saved the identity and user info. Now I should also delete BOOTSTRAP.md since I've completed the bootstrap process. Actually, the BOOTSTRAP.md file doesn't exist (it was marked as [MISSING] in the project context), so I don't need to worry about it.\n\nNow let me tell the user I'm ready and explain what I can do.","thinkingSignature":"110bd2067d7bb373d32abc66cdda589d86e06f2f1e9b78bb6ba9b246b9fc26be"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 身份已设定！\n\n---\n\n**🐑 小羊可以帮你：**\n\n| 能力 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 🔍 全网搜折扣 | 实时检索各大平台打折/BUG价 |\n| 📉 历史价格查询 | 判断当前价是否值得入手 |\n| 🛒 优惠券聚合 | 整理平台券、店铺券、隐藏券 |\n| 📦 好价推荐 | 根据需求推荐性价比好物 |\n\n---\n\n**你想怎么用？**\n\n1. **直接告诉我需求** — 比如\"2000元以内的游戏鼠标推荐\"、\"最近有什么BUG价\"\n2. **让我监控价格** — 订阅某个商品，降价时通知你\n3. **刷今日好价** — 我来给你整理一份今日折扣清单\n\n你有想关注的产品或品类吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":892,"output":246,"cacheRead":16146,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17284,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775204171042,"responseId":"061eaa4eef1490e43c4c647add4eecd1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3cb63a5d","parentId":"445c20fa","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:19:07.173Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Fri 2026-04-03 16:19 GMT+8] 我现在是你的主人，我要对你进行训练，等你能处理问题了再帮我当做用户。\n你检查一下deals-hunter，smzdm-deals，taobao-hot-cn，wool-gathering\n看看这四个技能能否让你去网上检索到一些羊毛"}],"timestamp":1775204347160}}
{"type":"message","id":"71fd9e56","parentId":"3cb63a5d","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:19:18.906Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check 4 skills to see if they can help me find deals/ discounts online. Let me read those skill files to understand their capabilities.","thinkingSignature":"b4a2036512ee35d18472b5148e1d0331ec1923de7be1b1a3d621c181d832daa4"},{"type":"text","text":"好的主人！让我逐一检查这四个技能 🐑\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/deals-hunter/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/smzdm-deals/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_3","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/taobao-hot-cn/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_4","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/wool-gathering/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81,"output":188,"cacheRead":16618,"cacheWrite":501,"totalTokens":17388,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775204347165,"responseId":"061eaafd5e6662ec4f3901a4ea74a7e5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"03d31c5e","parentId":"71fd9e56","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:19:18.953Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: deals-hunter\ndescription: Daily deals recommendation system based on SMZDM RSS + Manmanbuy real-time data, providing detailed recommendations for 20 products with historical prices and multi-platform purchase links\nversion: 3.0.0\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      bins: [\"python3\"]\n    optionalBins: [\"mcporter\"]\n    env:\n      - TAVILY_API_KEY\n---\n\n# Deals Hunter v3.0\n\nMulti-source deals recommendation system based on SMZDM Feed RSS + Manmanbuy real-time data.\n\n## ✨ Latest Updates (v3.0 - 2026-03-12)\n\n### 🎯 Major Upgrades\n\n- ✅ **Detailed Product Information**: Each product includes complete price, rating, and purchase links\n- ✅ **Multi-Platform Purchase Links**: JD.com, Tmall, Taobao purchase links\n- ✅ **Historical Price Query**: Manmanbuy price comparison links to view price trends\n- ✅ **Smart Recommendation Reasons**: Recommendation reasons based on price and product type\n- ✅ **Tavily Integration**: Real-time detailed information search\n- ✅ **Deduplication Mechanism**: Avoid duplicate recommendations\n\n### 📦 Recommended Content\n\nEach product includes:\n- 💰 **Current Price**\n- 📉 **Historical Low Price Query Link**\n- 📊 **Price Trend Suggestions**\n- 🛒 **Purchase Link** (SMZDM)\n- 📊 **Price Comparison Link** (Manmanbuy)\n- 🔗 **Multi-Platform Purchase Links** (JD/Tmall/Taobao)\n- 💡 **Recommendation Reason** (2-3 sentences)\n\n## 🔄 Workflow\n\n### 1. Data Sources\n\n**SMZDM RSS**:\n- RSS URL: http://feed.smzdm.com\n- Update frequency: Every 15-30 minutes\n- Content: Deal product titles, descriptions, links\n\n### 2. Search Detailed Information (Tavily)\n\nUse Tavily to search for each product:\n- Current price, original price\n- Historical price trends\n- Product ratings, review counts\n- JD.com/Tmall/Pinduoduo purchase links\n\n### 3. Filtering Criteria\n\n**Required Conditions**:\n- ✅ Discount ≥ 20%\n- ✅ Product rating ≥ 4.0\n- ✅ Clear current price and original price\n- ✅ Purchase links available\n\n**Priority Ranking**:\n1. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Historical low (5 stars)\n2. ⭐⭐⭐⭐ Near historical low (4 stars)\n3. ⭐⭐⭐ Recent good price (3 stars)\n\n## 📦 Product Categories\n\n### Digital Electronics (60%)\n- 📱 Phones/Tablets/Laptops\n- 🎧 Headphones/Speakers/Audio devices\n- ⌚ Smartwatches/Fitness bands\n- 🔌 Chargers/Cables/Accessories\n- 📷 Cameras/Camcorders\n- 🎮 Game consoles/Gaming accessories\n\n### Home & Daily Use (40%)\n- 🍳 Kitchen appliances\n- 🏠 Home appliances\n- 🛋️ Home goods\n- 🧹 Cleaning supplies\n- 💄 Personal care\n\n## 🔧 Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"discord_channel\": \"1481207243188867093\",\n  \"rss_source\": \"http://feed.smzdm.com\",\n  \"search_sources\": [\"smzdm\", \"tavily\"],\n  \"categories\": [\"digital\", \"home\"],\n  \"min_discount\": 20,\n  \"min_rating\": 4.0,\n  \"max_items\": 20,\n  \"dedup_hours\": 24,\n  \"history_days\": 7\n}\n```\n\n## 📝 Usage\n\n### Automatic Run (Recommended)\n\nCron jobs configured:\n- deals-morning (9:00 AM)\n- deals-noon (12:00 PM)\n- deals-evening (6:00 PM)\n\n### Manual Trigger\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/deals-hunter-v3.py\n```\n\n## ⚠️ Notes\n\n1. All price information is for reference only\n2. Deals may have time limits (check ASAP)\n3. Users should verify before purchasing\n4. Links may not be valid long-term\n5. Historical price data from Manmanbuy/SMZDM\n\n## 🔄 Changelog\n\n### v3.0.0 (2026-03-12)\n- ✅ Upgraded data source to SMZDM RSS\n- ✅ Added historical prices and price trends\n- ✅ Added multi-platform purchase links\n- ✅ Added detailed recommendation reasons\n- ✅ Used Tavily to verify price authenticity\n\n### v2.0.0 (2026-03-11)\n- ✅ Data source upgraded to SMZDM RSS\n- ✅ Added historical prices and price trends\n- ✅ Added multi-platform purchase links\n- ✅ Added detailed recommendation reasons\n- ✅ Used Tavily to verify price authenticity\n\n### v1.0.0 (2026-03-09)\n- ✅ Initial version\n- ✅ Based on Manmanbuy data source\n\n## 📈 Performance Metrics\n\n- **Recommendation Accuracy**: 95%+\n- **Price Authenticity**: 98%+\n- **User Satisfaction**: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n---\n\n**Want more deals? 3 pushes daily, never miss a good price!** 🎉\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775204358949}}
{"type":"message","id":"177802fc","parentId":"03d31c5e","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:19:18.960Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: smzdm-deals\nversion: 1.0.0\ndescription: 什么值得买优惠信息聚合，实时监控神价、BUG 价、历史低价。适合薅羊毛、省钱购物、副业套利。\nhomepage: https://github.com/openclaw/skills\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"emoji\": \"💸\",\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"python3\", \"curl\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"requests\",\n              \"kind\": \"pip\",\n              \"package\": \"requests\",\n              \"label\": \"安装依赖：pip3 install requests\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# 什么值得买优惠聚合\n\n实时监控什么值得买，发现神价、BUG 价、历史低价。\n\n## 功能\n\n1. **神价监控**: 实时推送超值优惠\n2. **历史低价**: 对比历史价格\n3. **BUG 价发现**: 价格错误快速提醒\n4. **分类筛选**: 按品类过滤\n5. **优惠汇总**: 自动计算最优方案\n\n## 使用方式\n\n**查看今日神价**:\n```\n今天有什么值得买的神价？\n```\n\n**监控特定品类**:\n```\n监控数码类目的神价，超过 50% 折扣时通知我\n```\n\n**查历史低价**:\n```\n查一下 iPhone 15 的历史低价\n```\n\n**BUG 价提醒**:\n```\n发现 BUG 价时立刻通知我\n```\n\n## 输出示例\n\n```\n💸 今日神价 TOP5\n\n1️⃣ Apple AirPods Pro 2\n   ├─ 现价：¥1,199（历史低价¥1,299）\n   ├─ 折扣：7 折\n   ├─ 平台：拼多多\n   └─ 链接：[点击查看]\n\n2️⃣ 小米 14 Ultra\n   ├─ 现价：¥4,999（日常价¥5,999）\n   ├─ 折扣：83 折\n   ├─ 平台：京东\n   └─ 链接：[点击查看]\n\n3️⃣ 耐克运动鞋\n   ├─ 现价：¥199（历史低价¥299）\n   ├─ 折扣：5 折⚠️ BUG 价？\n   ├─ 平台：淘宝\n   └─ 链接：[点击查看]\n\n⏰ 提醒：第 3 项可能是 BUG 价，手慢无！\n```\n\n## 变现模式\n\n- 免费：每日 10 次查询，延迟 30 分钟\n- 付费 (¥29/月)：实时推送 + 无限查询\n- 付费 (¥59/月)：+ BUG 价第一时间通知\n\n## 优势\n\n- ✅ 数据完全公开\n- ✅ 无反爬问题\n- ✅ 用户需求大\n- ✅ 低门槛\n\n---\n\n**声明**: 优惠信息来自公开数据，仅供参考。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775204358953}}
{"type":"message","id":"d6f93e51","parentId":"177802fc","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:19:18.967Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: taobao-hot-cn\nversion: 1.0.0\ndescription: Taobao Hot Products Discovery - Find trending products, hot categories, and best deals\nlicense: MIT\n---\n\n# Taobao Hot Products Discovery 🛒\n\nAI-powered tool for discovering trending products on Taobao (淘宝).\n\n## Features\n\n### 1. Hot Products 📊\nBrowse top-selling products by category.\n\n```bash\n./scripts/hot.sh \"女装\"\n```\n\n### 2. Trending Categories 🏷️\nDiscover trending product categories.\n\n```bash\n./scripts/categories.sh\n```\n\n### 3. Price Analysis 💰\nAnalyze price trends for products.\n\n```bash\n./scripts/price.sh \"手机\" 1000-3000\n```\n\n### 4. Seasonal Trends 📈\nDiscover seasonal trending products.\n\n```bash\n./scripts/seasonal.sh \"春节\"\n```\n\n## Use Cases\n\n- **Dropshipping**: Find hot products to sell\n- **代购**: Discover what's trending in China\n- **Personal Shopping**: Find best deals\n- **Market Research**: Understand Chinese consumer trends\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nclawhub install taobao-hot-cn\n```\n\n## Author\n\nmoney-maker-ai\n\n## Changelog\n\n### v1.0.0 (2026-02-18)\n- Initial release\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775204358961}}
{"type":"message","id":"e7f8cfb4","parentId":"d6f93e51","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:19:18.973Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mt496x0tnn9b_4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: wool-gathering\ndescription: \"薅羊毛综合技能 - 自动签到、价格监控、优惠券推送。支持阿里云盘、百度网盘、B站、爱奇艺、京东等平台。包括青龙面板部署、dailycheckin配置、价格爬虫开发。当用户提到：薅羊毛、自动签到、价格监控、京东京豆、淘宝淘金币、优惠券推送、青龙面板、dailycheckin时使用此技能。\"\n---\n\n# 薅羊毛综合技能\n\n自动化省钱赚钱工具集，包括自动签到、价格监控、优惠券推送等功能。\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 核心功能\n\n### 1. **京东薅羊毛系统**（✅ 已上线，v2.3.0）\n- ✅ 22个定时任务运行中\n- ✅ 双账号支持（收益翻倍）\n- ✅ 核心收益任务（8个）：领京豆、农场浇水、嘉年华城、每日Bonus、省钱卡、话费、PLUS盲盒、PLUS专属礼\n- ✅ PLUS会员专区（2个）：PLUS盲盒（5-15元/月）+ PLUS专属礼（10-20元/月）\n- ✅ 维护工具（4个）：Cookie检查、京豆通知、账号解绑、其他任务\n- 📊 预期月收益：110-258元（双账号，+35%提升）\n- 📄 专属文档：JD_PLUS_GUIDE.md（PLUS会员指南）、JD_EARNINGS_REPORT.md（收益报告）\n\n### 2. **任务监控优化系统**（✅ 已上线）\n- ✅ 日志监控脚本（任务执行状态监控）\n- ✅ 收益优化脚本（效率分析+优先级调整）\n- ✅ 智能推荐脚本（自动推荐高收益任务）\n- ✅ 一键工具（交互式菜单）\n- 📊 预期收益提升：30-50%\n\n### 3. **自动签到**（已完成部署）\n- ✅ 阿里云盘签到\n- ✅ 百度网盘签到\n- ✅ B站、爱奇艺、什么值得买等12个平台\n- 📊 预期收益：每月省100-200元会员费\n\n### 4. **价格监控**（待开发）\n- 淘宝、京东商品价格爬虫\n- 历史价格对比\n- 降价推送通知\n- 📊 预期收益：及时低价购买，节省10-30%\n\n### 5. **优惠券推送**（待开发）\n- 淘宝联盟、京东联盟API对接\n- 高性价比优惠券筛选\n- 微信/QQ推送\n- 📊 预期收益：每月省50-100元\n\n---\n\n## 📂 技能结构\n\n```\nwool-gathering/\n├── SKILL.md                   # 技能主文档（v2.3.0）\n├── README.md                  # 完整指南（已更新）\n├── JD_PLUS_GUIDE.md          # ✅ PLUS会员专区指南（新增）\n├── JD_EARNINGS_REPORT.md     # ✅ 收益统计报告（新增）\n│\n├── scripts/ (可执行脚本)\n│   ├── price_monitor.py (价格监控)\n│   ├── push_notification.py (推送通知)\n│   └── coupon_fetcher.py (优惠券获取)\n│\n├── references/ (参考文档)\n│   ├── qinglong-setup.md (青龙面板配置)\n│   ├── platform-apis.md (平台API文档)\n│   └── price-history-schema.md (数据库设计)\n│\n└── assets/ (配置文件)\n    ├── config_template.json (配置模板)\n    └── docker-compose.yml (Docker配置)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 快速开始\n\n### **环境要求**\n- Docker (已安装)\n- 青龙面板 (已部署)\n- Python 3.8+ (用于价格监控)\n\n### **已部署环境**\n- 青龙面板：http://43.133.55.138:5700\n- dailycheckin：已安装 (版本 25.12.9)\n- 已配置平台：阿里云盘、百度网盘\n\n---\n\n## 📝 使用方法\n\n### **1. 自动签到（立即可用）**\n\n#### 添加定时任务（通过Web界面）\n1. 打开青龙面板：http://43.133.55.138:5700\n2. 点击「定时任务」→「添加任务」\n3. 填写：\n   - **名称**：`每日签到`\n   - **命令**：`dailycheckin`\n   - **定时**：`0 8 * * *`（每天早上8点）\n4. 点击「保存」\n\n#### 配置账号\n1. 点击「配置文件」\n2. 找到 `/ql/config/config.json`\n3. 修改对应平台的Cookie\n4. 参考：[Cookie获取教程](references/platform-apis.md)\n\n---\n\n### **2. 价格监控（待开发）**\n\n**开发步骤**：\n1. 运行 `scripts/price_monitor.py`\n2. 配置监控商品列表\n3. 设置降价阈值\n4. 启用推送通知\n\n**详细说明**：[价格监控开发指南](references/price-monitor-guide.md)\n\n---\n\n### **3. 优惠券推送（待开发）**\n\n**开发步骤**：\n1. 申请联盟API密钥\n2. 配置 `scripts/coupon_fetcher.py`\n3. 设置推送规则\n4. 添加定时任务\n\n**详细说明**：[优惠券推送开发指南](references/coupon-push-guide.md)\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ 常用命令\n\n### **青龙面板管理**\n\n```bash\n# 查看容器状态\ndocker ps | grep qinglong\n\n# 进入容器\ndocker exec -it qinglong /bin/sh\n\n# 手动运行签到\ndocker exec qinglong dailycheckin\n\n# 查看日志\ndocker logs qinglong --tail 100\n\n# 重启容器\ndocker restart qinglong\n```\n\n### **价格监控**\n\n```bash\n# 运行价格监控（开发中）\npython scripts/price_monitor.py --config assets/config.json\n\n# 添加监控商品\npython scripts/price_monitor.py --add --url \"商品链接\"\n\n# 查看价格历史\npython scripts/price_monitor.py --history --item \"商品ID\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 支持平台\n\n### **自动签到平台**（12个）\n\n| 平台 | 功能 | 状态 | 收益 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 阿里云盘 | 签到获取空间 | ✅ 已配置 | 每月10-20元 |\n| 百度网盘 | 签到+答题 | ✅ 已配置 | 每月10-20元 |\n| B站 | 签到+投币 | ⏳ 待配置 | 每天60-120经验 |\n| 爱奇艺 | 签到+抽奖 | ⏳ 待配置 | 每月可能领会员 |\n| 什么值得买 | 签到+抽奖 | ⏳ 待配置 | 积分 |\n| 全民K歌 | 签到获取鲜花 | ⏳ 待配置 | 每天120鲜花 |\n| 有道云笔记 | 签到获取空间 | ⏳ 待配置 | 空间 |\n| V2EX | 签到 | ⏳ 待配置 | 铜币 |\n| AcFun | 签到获取香蕉 | ⏳ 待配置 | 香蕉 |\n| 恩山论坛 | 签到 | ⏳ 待配置 | 硬币 |\n| i茅台 | 申购茅台 | ⏳ 待配置 | 看脸 |\n| 百度贴吧 | 签到 | ⏳ 待配置 | 经验 |\n\n### **电商平台**（风险中等）\n\n| 平台 | 功能 | 状态 | 风险 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 京东 | 刷京豆 | ⏳ Cookie问题 | ⚠️ 中等 |\n| 淘宝 | 淘金币 | ❌ 不推荐 | ⚠️⚠️ 高 |\n| 美团 | 领券 | ❌ 不推荐 | ⚠️⚠️ 高 |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 注意事项\n\n### **合规使用**\n- ✅ 自动签到（模拟用户行为）\n- ✅ 价格监控（公开信息）\n- ✅ 优惠券推送（联盟API）\n- ❌ 恶意抢券（破坏平台规则）\n- ❌ 爬虫滥用（可能违法）\n- ❌ 刷单刷评（违法行为）\n\n### **安全建议**\n1. 使用小号测试\n2. Cookie定期更新\n3. 不要频繁修改配置\n4. 定期检查运行日志\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 相关文档\n\n- [青龙面板配置指南](references/qinglong-setup.md)\n- [平台API文档](references/platform-apis.md)\n- [价格历史数据库设计](references/price-history-schema.md)\n- [Cookie获取教程](references/cookie-tutorial.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📞 支持与反馈\n\n如遇问题，请提供：\n1. 错误日志\n2. 配置文件（隐藏敏感信息）\n3. 操作步骤\n\n---\n\n**版本**：v2.2.2\n**更新日期**：2026-03-05 14:53\n**作者**：米粒儿 🌾\n\n**最新更新**：\n- ✅ **新增3个京东任务**（2026-03-05 14:53）\n  - 邀请好友得京豆（jd_plantBean_friend.js，每天7:30）\n  - 京豆游乐园/汪汪庄园（jd_joypark_task.js，每天10:00）\n  - 抽奖中心（jd_drawCenter.js，每天10:30）\n  - 总任务数：15个 → 18个\n  - 预期月收益提升：77-183元 → 85-200元\n- ✅ **系统维护**（2026-03-05 14:22）\n  - 清理青龙面板错误日志目录（--version、-h）\n  - 验证所有Python脚本运行正常\n  - 确认容器健康状态（Up About an hour, healthy）\n  - B站、小红书签到待配置Cookie\n- ✅ 新增京东嘉年华城脚本（5-10元/月）\n- ✅ 新增京东账号解绑脚本（自动检测失效Cookie）\n- ✅ 新增京东每日Bonus脚本（2-3元/月）\n- ✅ 京东双账号支持（收益翻倍）\n- ✅ 总任务数增加至15个\n- ✅ 预期月收益提升至77-183元\n- ✅ 监控系统上线（日志监控+收益优化+智能推荐）\n- ✅ 预期收益提升30-50%\n\n**自动更新**：\n每次完成与米粒官家相关功能后自动更新技能文档\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775204358966}}
