{"type":"message","id":"caca6e18","parentId":"f526d48e","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:24:29.580Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"网络问题导致 fetch 失败。让我给用户汇报一下现状。","thinkingSignature":"74f07f64e03d44f95f4d00f8b2eb3d9665c5cddccc04d51355eb9cbf78e5483c"},{"type":"text","text":"网络环境有些限制，让我总结一下目前的情况：\n\n---\n\n## 🐑 小羊训练报告\n\n### ✅ 四个技能检查结果\n\n| 技能 | 脚本数量 | 可执行性 | 备注 |\n|------|---------|---------|------|\n| **deals-hunter** | 1个 Python | ⚠️ 需 Tavily API | 依赖外部API |\n| **smzdm-deals** | 0个 | ⚠️ 仅有文档 | 需手动编写脚本 |\n| **taobao-hot-cn** | 4个 Shell | ❌ Windows无法运行 | 缺少 bash |\n| **wool-gathering** | 12个 Python | ✅ 可运行 | 已部署在青龙面板 |\n\n### 🌐 网络环境\n\n- ❌ 百度搜索：被验证拦截\n- ❌ DuckDuckGo：fetch 失败\n- ❌ SMZDM/淘宝：403 反爬\n\n---\n\n## 📋 训练结论\n\n**当前能力：**\n\n1. ✅ **wool-gathering** - 可以运行京东价格脚本、淘宝价格脚本\n2. ✅ **deals-hunter** - 有了 Tavily API Key 后可启用\n3. ⚠️ **搜索能力** - 受限于网络环境，需要主人调整\n\n**建议：**\n\n1. 📌 **配置 Tavily API Key**（给 deals-hunter 用）\n2. 📌 **网络环境优化**（让我能访问更多平台）\n3. 📌 **明确训练目标** — 主人想让我专注于哪类羊毛？\n   - 京东/淘宝/拼多多 **商品价格监控**\n   - **BUG价**发现与推送\n   - **历史低价**查询\n   - **优惠券**聚合\n\n---\n\n主人，你想先从哪个方向开始训练小羊？🐑"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10630,"output":390,"cacheRead":16146,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27166,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775204653120,"responseId":"061eac3049fa2ad0d514ed08fca91d8a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"45ff2715","parentId":"caca6e18","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:27:22.960Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Fri 2026-04-03 16:27 GMT+8] wool-gathering 试试呢看看能不能搜，把其他不能搜的Skills给他删了吧\n就用wool-gathering结合mult-search的技能搜"}],"timestamp":1775204842946}}
{"type":"message","id":"4ea53bcc","parentId":"45ff2715","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:27:40.414Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"主人要我：\n1. 试试 wool-gathering 能不能搜\n2. 删除其他不能搜的技能（deals-hunter, smzdm-deals, taobao-hot-cn）\n3. 用 wool-gathering 结合 multi-search 来搜\n\n让我先试试 wool-gathering 的脚本能不能跑起来，然后用 multi-search 技能来搜索羊毛信息。\n\n首先我需要了解：\n1. wool-gathering 里的脚本怎么用\n2. multi-search 怎么结合使用\n\n让我先读一下 wool-gathering 的脚本内容，了解它的功能，然后尝试运行。","thinkingSignature":"dd146653f869f5367d5cd309383ec99b01798ea14ce38b6de9f16b405738b9af"},{"type":"text","text":"好的主人！让我试试 wool-gathering + multi-search 组合 🌟\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3hw3ffubwnth_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\wool-gathering\\scripts\\jd_price_api_simple.py"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3hw3ffubwnth_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\wool-gathering\\scripts\\taobao_price_simple.py"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81,"output":225,"cacheRead":16146,"cacheWrite":10450,"totalTokens":26902,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775204842951,"responseId":"061eaced0693ea777b93ffa40fba9dd7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"16218f05","parentId":"4ea53bcc","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:27:40.447Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3hw3ffubwnth_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\n京东价格爬虫 - 简化版\n直接使用requests，无需额外依赖\n\"\"\"\n\nimport re\nimport json\nimport time\nimport requests\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n\nclass JDPriceSpiderSimple:\n    \"\"\"京东价格爬虫（简化版）\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.session = requests.Session()\n\n    def get_price_api(self, sku_id):\n        \"\"\"使用京东价格API\"\"\"\n        url = f\"https://p.3.cn/prices/mgets?skuIds=J_{sku_id}&type=1\"\n\n        headers = {\n            'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36',\n            'Referer': f'https://item.jd.com/{sku_id}.html'\n        }\n\n        try:\n            response = self.session.get(url, headers=headers, timeout=10)\n\n            if response.status_code == 200:\n                data = response.json()\n\n                if data and len(data) > 0:\n                    price = float(data[0].get('p', 0))\n                    original_price = float(data[0].get('m', price)) if data[0].get('m') else price\n\n                    return {\n                        'success': True,\n                        'platform': 'jd',\n                        'item_id': sku_id,\n                        'title': f'京东商品-{sku_id}',\n                        'price': price,\n                        'original_price': original_price,\n                        'url': f'https://item.jd.com/{sku_id}.html',\n                        'source': 'api',\n                        'timestamp': datetime.now().isoformat()\n                    }\n\n            return {'success': False, 'error': f'HTTP {response.status_code}'}\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            return {'success': False, 'error': str(e)}\n\n    def get_item_page(self, sku_id):\n        \"\"\"从商品页面提取信息\"\"\"\n        url = f\"https://item.jd.com/{sku_id}.html\"\n\n        headers = {\n            'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36'\n        }\n\n        try:\n            response = self.session.get(url, headers=headers, timeout=10)\n            response.encoding = 'utf-8'\n\n            # 提取标题\n            title_match = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', response.text)\n            title = title_match.group(1).replace(' -京东', '').strip() if title_match else f'京东商品-{sku_id}'\n\n            # 提取价格\n            price_match = re.search(r'\"price\":\"([\\d.]+)\"', response.text)\n\n            if price_match:\n                price = float(price_match.group(1))\n\n                return {\n                    'success': True,\n                    'platform': 'jd',\n                    'item_id': sku_id,\n                    'title': title,\n                    'price': price,\n                    'url': url,\n                    'source': 'page',\n                    'timestamp': datetime.now().isoformat()\n                }\n\n            return {'success': False, 'error': '页面未找到价格'}\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            return {'success': False, 'error': str(e)}\n\n    def get_price(self, sku_id):\n        \"\"\"获取价格（自动尝试多种方法）\"\"\"\n        print(f\"🔍 获取京东商品价格: {sku_id}\")\n\n        # 方法1: API（推荐）\n        result = self.get_price_api(sku_id)\n        if result.get('success'):\n            print(f\"✅ API成功: ¥{result['price']}\")\n            return result\n\n        print(f\"⚠️ API失败，尝试页面解析...\")\n\n        # 方法2: 页面解析\n        result = self.get_item_page(sku_id)\n        if result.get('success'):\n            print(f\"✅ 页面解析成功: ¥{result['price']}\")\n            return result\n\n        print(f\"❌ 所有方法都失败\")\n        return {'success': False, 'item_id': sku_id, 'error': '无法获取价格'}\n\n\ndef test():\n    \"\"\"测试\"\"\"\n    spider = JDPriceSpiderSimple()\n\n    # 测试商品\n    test_items = [\n        '100012043978',  # iPhone 15 Pro Max\n        '100048127491',  # 华为 Mate 60 Pro\n    ]\n\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n    print(\"京东价格爬虫测试\")\n    print(\"=\"*60)\n\n    for sku_id in test_items:\n        print(f\"\\n--- 测试: {sku_id} ---\")\n        result = spider.get_price(sku_id)\n\n        if result.get('success'):\n            print(f\"   商品: {result.get('title')}\")\n            print(f\"   价格: ¥{result.get('price')}\")\n            print(f\"   原价: ¥{result.get('original_price')}\")\n            print(f\"   来源: {result.get('source')}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"   失败: {result.get('error')}\")\n\n        time.sleep(1)\n\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    test()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775204860439}}
{"type":"message","id":"76fdc9c3","parentId":"16218f05","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:27:40.454Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3hw3ffubwnth_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\n淘宝价格爬虫 - 简化版\n基于真实API，简化实现\n\"\"\"\n\nimport re\nimport json\nimport time\nimport requests\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n\nclass TaobaoPriceSpiderSimple:\n    \"\"\"淘宝价格爬虫（简化版）\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.session = requests.Session()\n        self.session.headers.update({\n            'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 14_0 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15',\n            'Accept': '*/*',\n            'Accept-Language': 'zh-CN,zh;q=0.9',\n        })\n\n    def extract_item_id(self, url_or_id):\n        \"\"\"提取商品ID\"\"\"\n        if url_or_id.isdigit():\n            return url_or_id\n\n        patterns = [\n            r'[&?]id=(\\d+)',\n            r'/i(\\d+)',\n        ]\n\n        for pattern in patterns:\n            match = re.search(pattern, url_or_id)\n            if match:\n                return match.group(1)\n\n        return None\n\n    def get_item_info(self, item_id):\n        \"\"\"\n        获取商品信息（简化版）\n        使用淘宝H5接口\n        \"\"\"\n        url = f\"https://h5api.m.taobao.com/h5/mtop.taobao.detailmtopstability.getitemdetail/1.0/\"\n\n        params = {\n            'jsv': '2.5.1',\n            'appKey': '12574478',\n            't': str(int(time.time() * 1000)),\n            'api': 'mtop.taobao.detailmtopstability.getitemdetail',\n            'v': '1.0',\n            'type': 'json',\n            'dataType': 'json',\n            'data': f'{{\"itemNumId\":\"{item_id}\"}}'\n        }\n\n        try:\n            response = self.session.get(url, params=params, timeout=10)\n\n            if response.status_code == 200:\n                data = response.json()\n\n                # 解析返回数据\n                ret_list = data.get('data', {}).get('ret', [])\n\n                if ret_list and 'SUCCESS' in ret_list[0]:\n                    item_info = data.get('data', {}).get('data', {})\n\n                    title = item_info.get('title', f'淘宝商品-{item_id}')\n                    price_str = item_info.get('price', '0')\n\n                    # 解析价格\n                    try:\n                        price = float(price_str.replace('¥', '').replace(',', ''))\n                    except:\n                        price = 0.0\n\n                    if price > 0:\n                        return {\n                            'success': True,\n                            'platform': 'taobao',\n                            'item_id': item_id,\n                            'title': title,\n                            'price': price,\n                            'original_price': price,\n                            'url': f'https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id={item_id}',\n                            'source': 'h5_api',\n                            'timestamp': datetime.now().isoformat()\n                        }\n\n            return {'success': False, 'error': 'API返回异常'}\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            return {'success': False, 'error': str(e)}\n\n    def get_price(self, item_id_or_url):\n        \"\"\"获取价格\"\"\"\n        item_id = self.extract_item_id(item_id_or_url)\n\n        if not item_id:\n            print(f\"❌ 无效的商品ID或URL\")\n            return {'success': False, 'error': '无效输入'}\n\n        print(f\"🔍 获取淘宝商品价格: {item_id}\")\n\n        result = self.get_item_info(item_id)\n\n        if result['success']:\n            print(f\"✅ 成功: ¥{result['price']}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"❌ 失败: {result['error']}\")\n\n        return result\n\n\ndef test():\n    \"\"\"测试\"\"\"\n    spider = TaobaoPriceSpiderSimple()\n\n    # 测试商品ID（需要真实的淘宝商品ID）\n    test_items = [\n        '560852934047',  # 示例商品ID\n    ]\n\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n    print(\"淘宝价格爬虫测试\")\n    print(\"=\"*60)\n\n    for item_id in test_items:\n        print(f\"\\n--- 测试: {item_id} ---\")\n        result = spider.get_price(item_id)\n\n        if result['success']:\n            print(f\"   商品: {result['title']}\")\n            print(f\"   价格: ¥{result['price']}\")\n            print(f\"   链接: {result['url']}\")\n\n        time.sleep(1)\n\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n    print(\"提示: 淘宝API需要真实的商品ID才能返回数据\")\n    print(\"建议: 使用真实的淘宝商品ID进行测试\")\n    print(\"=\"*60)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    test()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775204860447}}
{"type":"message","id":"e53d43f7","parentId":"76fdc9c3","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:27:58.722Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我看到了京东和淘宝的价格爬虫脚本。现在让我：\n\n1. 尝试运行这些脚本看看能不能搜\n2. 同时用 multi-search 来搜索羊毛信息\n\n让我先用multi-search搜索一些羊毛信息，然后用搜索结果来测试。","thinkingSignature":"b304036f46b143bb8e884e4d5c139f08b8e9087125236e5d165159bd95c66dda"},{"type":"text","text":"好，让我先删除其他三个技能，然后用 multi-search + wool-gathering 脚本结合搜索 🐑\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n5fv3xeb6dtn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"Remove-Item -Recurse -Force 'C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\deals-hunter' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Remove-Item -Recurse -Force 'C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\smzdm-deals' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Remove-Item -Recurse -Force 'C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\taobao-hot-cn' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; echo 'Done'\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12907,"output":209,"cacheRead":16146,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775204860454,"responseId":"061eacff2527c33b03c48d9ade876b25"}}
