{"type":"message","id":"89fc5f6d","parentId":"f7381111","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:13:53.138Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在让我总结一下给主人","thinkingSignature":"e6ddc28c2579fc9f52c4a5725190b7f0bbe81892d38ca239b585db62b758ce28"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ 测试完成！总结给主人\n\n### 🏆 最佳搜索组合\n\n| 优先级 | 引擎 | 工具 | 用途 |\n|--------|------|------|------|\n| 1️⃣ | **搜狗微信** | wechat-toolkit | 公众号羊毛文章（真实链接） |\n| 2️⃣ | **360移动搜索** | 直接抓取 | 备选优惠信息 |\n| 3️⃣ | **头条搜索** | 直接抓取 | 活动资讯 |\n\n### 📝 搜索命令\n\n```bash\n# 搜狗微信（主力）\nnode wechat-toolkit/scripts/search/search_wechat.js \"关键词\" -n 10 -r\n\n# 360搜索\nweb_fetch(url=\"https://m.so.com/s?q={关键词}\")\n\n# 头条搜索\nweb_fetch(url=\"https://so.toutiao.com/search?keyword={关键词}\")\n```\n\n### ⚠️ 已知问题\n- 百度被拦截\n- 很多微信文章日期较旧（1-3月），需筛选4月内容\n\n---\n\n小羊现在掌握了完整的搜索技能！🐑\n\n**主人可以随时说：**\n- \"搜今天的神价\"\n- \"帮我找京东的优惠\"\n- \"看看4月有什么打折\"\n\n小羊马上行动！"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":105222,"output":280,"cacheRead":16146,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":121648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775207621420,"responseId":"061eb7c83c03cbb10fe8662c861716a0"}}
